## Debugging Tips

### Check API Key Setup

```javascript
// In browser console
import khoi from './khoi-client.js';
const config = khoi.getConfig();
console.log('API URL:', config.apiUrl);
console.log('API Key Set:', !!config.apiKey);
console.log('User ID:', config.userId);
```

### Test API Call

```javascript
// In browser console
import khoi from './khoi-client.js';
const readiness = await khoi.getReadiness();
console.log('Readiness Data:', readiness);
```

### Monitor Sync State

```javascript
// In browser console
import syncManager from './data-sync.js';
console.log('Sync State:', syncManager.getState());
console.log('Last Sync Times:', syncManager.getState().lastSyncTime);
console.log('Failed Metrics:', syncManager.getFailedMetrics());
```

### View Network Requests

```javascript
// Enable request logging
localStorage.debug = 'khoi:*';

// Then check console for detailed logs
```

